  "details": "Hello, I am experiencing an issue immediately after logging into VRChat.\n\nOnce I log in, the game keeps switching back and forth between my custom Home World and the default Home World continuously. Eventually, it crashes with Error 429.\n\nI have already tried the following troubleshooting steps, but none of them worked:\n\nUninstalled and reinstalled VRChat.\n\nDeleted the \"VRChat\" folder located in the LocalLow directory.\n\nUpdated my graphics drivers.\n\nTried using a VPN.\n\nCould you please provide a solution for this issue?",
